WEBVTT

00:14:26.579 --> 00:14:31.662
And yet at the same time, she had female
characteristics and she adopted

00:14:31.662 --> 00:14:33.621
a whole lot of motherless orphans.

00:14:34.371 --> 00:14:41.537
So they they seem to behave more in
tune with when, like you say,

00:14:41.662 --> 00:14:44.954
they can't talk, they don't speak,
they don't discuss.

00:14:45.579 --> 00:14:48.079
So they just behave the way they feel.

00:14:49.162 --> 00:14:54.829
Which is why I always say, you know,
only humans can be really evil,

00:14:55.121 --> 00:14:59.579
chimps can be brutal and aggressive
and kill and have a kind of war,